sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Reporter as Citizen Reporter (Mobile)
    participant Cache as SQLite Local Cache
    participant API as Django REST Gateway
    participant Celery as Celery Async Task
    participant Deduper as AI Deduplication & NLP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + PostGIS
    actor Officer as Woreda Disaster Officer

    Reporter->>Cache: 1. Submit Report & Photo (Offline)
    Note over Reporter,Cache: No Network Required
    Reporter->>API: 2. Network Restored -> Sync Batch
    API->>DB: 3. Store Raw Incident (Status: REPORTED)
    API->>Celery: 4. Dispatch Async Processing Task
    API-->>Reporter: 5. 202 Accepted (Sync Acknowledged)
    Celery->>Deduper: 6. Spatial Buffer Check (1.5km, 48h)
    Deduper->>Deduper: 7. Amharic/English NLP Summarization
    Deduper->>DB: 8. Update Incident (AI Triage, Trust Score)
    Celery->>Officer: 9. Push Real-Time Triage Alert
    Officer->>DB: 10. Ground Inspection & Mark VERIFIED
